#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.1.rst:4
msgid "v5.1.1"
msgstr "v5.1.1"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v5.1.1 is a macOS point release. Every tool OpenMV IDE runs on a Mac now "
"ships as a native Apple Silicon build, so firmware updates, the language "
"server, and the other bundled tools keep working on macOS releases that no "
"longer include the Intel translation layer. Nothing changes on Windows or "
"Linux. It is built on Qt Creator 14.0.2 and bundles firmware v5.0.1."
msgstr ""
"v5.1.1 is een macOS-puntrelease. Elk hulpprogramma dat OpenMV IDE op een Mac"
" uitvoert, wordt nu geleverd als native Apple Silicon-build, zodat firmware-"
"updates, de language server en de andere meegeleverde hulpprogramma's "
"blijven werken op macOS-versies die de Intel-vertaallaag niet meer bevatten."
" Op Windows en Linux verandert er niets. Het is gebouwd op Qt Creator 14.0.2"
" en bevat firmware v5.0.1."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.1.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Op deze pagina"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.1.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Hoogtepunten"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.1.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Native Apple Silicon tools** -- the bundled dfu-util, picotool, bossac, "
"STM32CubeProgrammer, the NXP flashing tools, FFmpeg, the Python language "
"server, and the Node.js runtime used by GitHub Copilot are now native arm64 "
"builds on Apple Silicon Macs. The Intel builds of these tools failed on "
"recent macOS releases, which surfaced as firmware updates and other tools "
"failing with errors such as \"query failed\" (`36d4d9cf615 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/36d4d9cf615>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Native Apple Silicon-hulpprogramma's** -- de meegeleverde dfu-util, "
"picotool, bossac, STM32CubeProgrammer, de NXP-flashprogramma's, FFmpeg, de "
"Python language server en de Node.js-runtime die GitHub Copilot gebruikt, "
"zijn nu native arm64-builds op Apple Silicon-Macs. De Intel-builds van deze "
"hulpprogramma's mislukten op recente macOS-versies, wat zichtbaar werd als "
"mislukte firmware-updates en andere hulpprogramma's met fouten zoals \"query"
" failed\" (`36d4d9cf615 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/36d4d9cf615>`__)."

